' The approved dependencies between the projects of the monorepo.
' `archTest` fails on any dependency between projects that is not listed here.
' Use the exact project names and the bracket form on both sides of an arrow.
' ArchUnitTS compares the text of an arrow with the project name. An alias
' does not match.
@startuml
component [@aade/contracts]
component [@aade/core]

[@aade/core] --> [@aade/contracts]
@enduml
